flowchart LR
    U((User)) -->|click NEW GAME| TS[TitleScreen]
    TS -->|Open NewGame| MM[MenuManager]
    MM --> NGS[NewGameScreen]
    U -->|fill name + START| NGS
    NGS --> NGSv[NewGameService.StartNewGame]
    NGSv -->|SaveExists?| Branch{Existing<br/>save?}
    Branch -->|yes| Confirm["MenuManager.OpenWithArgs<br/>ConfirmDialog"]
    Confirm -->|user confirms| Run
    Branch -->|no| Run
    Run["1. SaveDataGateway.Delete<br/>2. GameLaunchContext.SetNewGame name<br/>3. SceneTransitionService.LoadMainWorldScene"]
    Run --> STO[SceneTransitionOverlay]
    STO -->|fade in + LoadSceneAsync| SM[(SceneManager)]
    SM --> WG["WorldGrid.Start<br/>(MainWorldScene)"]
    WG -->|reads| GLC[GameLaunchContext]
    WG -->|seeds Player.Name<br/>resets context to Continue| Done[Next save uses world name]
